+
+### Minor Changes
+
+- [#1000](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/pull/1000) by [@bobsingor](https://github.com/bobsingor) – `readProgram()` replaces `getProgram()`: a read from the engine is `read*`.
