+
+### Patch Changes
+
+- [#974](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/pull/974) by [@bobsingor](https://github.com/bobsingor) – A font's CSS and a box's paint fonts end their fallbacks with the standard font that stands in for the font, as the engine writes them: Latin a font lacks (Noto Sans Hebrew has none) shows in Helvetica, in the same weight, never as boxes.
+
