@@ -1,5 +1,19 @@
 # @embedpdf/plugin-search
 
+## 3.0.0-next.23
+
+### Minor Changes
+
+- [#1003](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/pull/1003) by [@bobsingor](https://github.com/bobsingor) – `highlight.blendMode` is engine-core's `BlendMode`; the `SearchBlendMode` copy is gone.
+
+- [#1000](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/pull/1000) by [@bobsingor](https://github.com/bobsingor) – `refresh()` resolves nothing, as every plugin's does; the result is in the state and the events.
+
+### Patch Changes
+
+- [#983](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/pull/983) by [@bobsingor](https://github.com/bobsingor) – A search asks for snippets only when the session may copy text (`doc.text.copy`). Before, it always asked for them first and, when refused, searched again without them: two requests for every search in a session without copy rights. `findAll(query, { snippets: true })` now refuses with `permission-denied` (naming `doc.text.copy`) without asking the engine. If the engine still refuses snippets the session looked allowed to have, the search falls back to matches without them as before.
+
+## 3.0.0-next.22
+
 ## 3.0.0-next.21
 
